                <pb facs="0541" n="429" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg429"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3294/29.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Consul-General Skinner to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Marseilles</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-06-08"><hi rendition="#italic">June 8,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Jacobs’s imprisonment continues, although extradition authorized March 30.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
